[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0010","text":"————啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0012","text":"小孩1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0020","text":"呜哦——接招吧！\n正义飞踢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0021","text":"小孩2"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0030","text":"好痛！\n呀哈哈哈哈哈"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0040","text":"……\n哈哈，真有精神啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0060","text":"……我说，果穗\n难得出来一趟，要不要顺路去个地方？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0070","text":"…………可是……风印…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0080","text":"你看，今天采访一直坐着没动过\n我也想换个心情……如果果穗愿意的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0090","text":"────最后一击！\n正义铁拳！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_02_0100","text":"呜哇—！！"}]
